{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Efficiency measures the proportion of the total energy input that is transferred usefully. The equation is efficiency equals useful energy output divided by total energy input. To express efficiency as a percentage, multiply the decimal answer by one hundred. You can also calculate efficiency using useful power output divided by total power input. Use energy with energy, or power with power; do not mix them in the same ratio.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": false}", "duration": 28.872, "words": [["Efficiency", 0.102083], ["measures", 0.740125], ["the", 1.091666], ["proportion", 1.247916], ["of", 1.703666], ["the", 1.846875], ["total", 1.990125], ["energy", 2.354708], ["input", 2.823458], ["that", 3.227083], ["is", 3.422416], ["transferred", 3.578666], ["usefully.", 3.995333], ["The", 5.45575], ["equation", 5.664083], ["is", 6.106791], ["efficiency", 6.210958], ["equals", 6.914083], ["useful", 7.278666], ["energy", 7.64325], ["output", 8.112], ["divided", 8.528666], ["by", 8.997416], ["total", 9.153666], ["energy", 9.51825], ["input.", 9.987], ["To", 11.471375], ["express", 11.601583], ["efficiency", 12.044291], ["as", 12.669291], ["a", 12.825541], ["percentage,", 12.942708], ["multiply", 13.828125], ["the", 14.375], ["decimal", 14.505208], ["answer", 14.947916], ["by", 15.2995], ["one", 15.46875], ["hundred.", 15.690125], ["You", 17.135416], ["can", 17.356791], ["also", 17.513041], ["calculate", 17.838541], ["efficiency", 18.294291], ["using", 18.984375], ["useful", 19.270833], ["power", 19.622416], ["output", 19.947916], ["divided", 20.377625], ["by", 20.833333], ["total", 20.989583], ["power", 21.315125], ["input.", 21.653666], ["Use", 23.138041], ["energy", 23.450541], ["with", 23.854166], ["energy,", 24.075541], ["or", 24.869791], ["power", 25.078125], ["with", 25.377625], ["power;", 25.598958], ["do", 26.210958], ["not", 26.341166], ["mix", 26.5495], ["them", 26.848958], ["in", 27.03125], ["the", 27